{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Thus his compassions were corrupted</b> — that they were in one womb." "<b>And the he preserved</b> [read: והי\"א שמר — 'the he' is likely והי\"א, 'and the yod-he'] — The he led, and like it: ויקרא לה נבח (and like it many)."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {1 "The lemma as printed reads וה\"א (the he); likely a corruption of והי\"א (and the yod-he), referring to the divine name element in the verse. Translated hyper-literally as it stands."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:17:45.121762365Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}